  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialDescriptions_tr-TR
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: tr-TR
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 787f9328ab1102f4dbe15593b57817be, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 112356413440
    m_Localized: "Hareket et, b\xFCy\xFC yap ve sald\u0131r\u0131lardan s\u0131yr\u0131l\u0131p
      rakiplerini nakavt etmek i\xE7in at\u0131l."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 152374267904
    m_Localized: "Rakipleri Arenan\u0131n d\u0131\u015F\u0131na f\u0131rlatmak i\xE7in
      <color=#FFF8A1>2 B\xFCy\xFCn\xFC</color> kullan.\r\n\r\nYerden yeni B\xFCy\xFCler
      <color=#CB98ED>Topla</color>, bu onlar\u0131n <color=#CB98ED>Bekleme S\xFCresini</color>
      s\u0131f\u0131rlayacakt\u0131r.\r\n\r\n<color=#FF3D5E>Hasar</color> biriktirmek
      i\xE7in Oyuncular\u0131\r\nB\xFCy\xFClerle vur. Ne kadar \xE7ok Hasarlar\u0131\r\nvarsa,
      o kadar uza\u011Fa<color=#FF3D5E> savrulurlar</color>. \r\n\r\nB\xFCy\xFCleri
      <color=#FFF8A1>Antrenman Alan\u0131nda</color> test et."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 196011806720
    m_Localized: "<color=#CB98ED>4 Oyuncuya</color> kadar <color=#CB98ED>herkes tek</color>
      veya <color=#CB98ED>Tak\u0131m tabanl\u0131</color> sava\u015Flarda m\xFCcadele
      edin. \n<color=#CB98ED>Ayakta kalan son ki\u015Fi</color> olarak\nPuan kazan\u0131n.
      \nEn \xE7ok Puana sahip Oyuncu kazan\u0131r.\n\n\xD6zel Turlar olu\u015Fturmak
      i\xE7in Lobide <color=#FFF8A1>Ma\xE7 Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131</color> de\u011Fi\u015Ftirin.\n\nOynayarak
      ve <color=#FFF8A1>Ba\u015Far\u0131mlar\u0131</color> tamamlayarak <color=#FFF8A1>yeni
      Wizzolar\u0131n</color> kilidini a\xE7\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 217025269760
    m_Localized: "En fazla 4 oyuncu herkesin tek oldu\u011Fu bir modda sava\u015F\u0131r,
      hayatta kalan son ki\u015Fi olarak puan kazan\u0131r. En \xE7ok puan\u0131
      alan oyuncu kazan\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 254539124736
    m_Localized: "<color=#86D1F0>Kaygan $</color> - Oyuncular \xFCzerindeki Savrulmay\u0131
      ve Baloncuklar\u0131n H\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r.\n\n<color=#FFA845>Baharatl\u0131
      {</color> - Bir \u0130\u015Faret uygular. Bir sonraki vuru\u015F \u0130\u015Fareti
      tetikleyerek ekstra Hasar ve Savrulma verir.\n\n<color=#FFA1F9>Yava\u015Flat\u0131lm\u0131\u015F
      }</color> - Hem Wizzolar hem de Baloncuklar daha yava\u015F hareket eder. Wizzolar
      At\u0131lma yetene\u011Fini kullanamaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 282519326720
    m_Localized: "Wizzo Popout, en fazla 4 oyuncu i\xE7in\\ntempolu, 3D ku\u015F
      bak\u0131\u015F\u0131 bir arena ni\u015Fanc\u0131 oyunudur.\\n\\nB\xFCy\xFCler
      yap, patlamalardan s\u0131yr\u0131l ve rakiplerini arenan\u0131n d\u0131\u015F\u0131na
      f\u0131rlat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 319974461440
    m_Localized: "Dinlendirici bir plaj g\xFCn\xFCn\xFCn ortas\u0131nda Wizzolar
      \xE7ileden \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor. \nDikkat! Bu plajda\nhi\xE7bir \u015Fey g\xF6r\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFC
      gibi de\u011Fil.\n\n<color=#FF5162>Harita Etkinli\u011Fi:</color> Sinsi Midyeler
      sahte e\u015Fyalarla Wizzolar\u0131 tuzaklar\u0131na \xE7eker. \xC7ok yakla\u015Ft\u0131klar\u0131nda
      Midyeler kapanarak b\xFCy\xFCk miktarda hasar verir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 354535526400
    m_Localized: "Sokaklar g\xFCvenli de\u011Fil! \u0130syan eden bir grup Wizzo,
      anla\u015Fmazl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 ya\u011Fmur suyu ve \xFCrk\xFCt\xFCc\xFC
      art\u0131klarla dolu bir Ton Bal\u0131\u011F\u0131 Kutusunda \xE7\xF6z\xFCyor.\n\n<color=#5FFF6A>Harita
      Etkinli\u011Fi:</color> Bal\u0131k K\u0131l\xE7\u0131klar\u0131 Kutunun etraf\u0131nda
      d\xF6nerek hareketli engeller olu\u015Fturur. \xC7arpt\u0131klar\u0131nda hem
      at\u0131\u015Flar\u0131 hem de Wizzolar\u0131 geri yans\u0131t\u0131rlar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375968419840
    m_Localized: "Orijinal Wizzo Popout:\nMutfak Eviyesindeki Bula\u015F\u0131klar
      \nYanl\u0131\u015Fl\u0131kla k\xFC\xE7\xFCld\xFCkten sonra, anla\u015Fmazl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131
      son bir kez \xE7\xF6zme vakti geldi: Temizlik s\u0131ras\u0131 kimde?\n\n<color=#5AE2FF>Harita
      Etkinli\u011Fi:</color> K\xF6p\xFCkl\xFC Ya\u011Fmur dalgalar\u0131 taba\u011Fa
      s\u0131\xE7rayarak zemini \u0131slak ve <color=#5AE2FF>kaygan $</color> b\u0131rak\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 398634438656
    m_Localized: "Bitmek bilmeyen tart\u0131\u015Fmalar\u0131 devam ederken Wizzolar
      kendilerini yeni kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015F bir yahninin s\u0131ca\u011F\u0131nda
      sava\u015F\u0131rken bulur.\n\n<color=#FFA845>Harita Etkinli\u011Fi:</color>
      Yiyecek Par\xE7alar\u0131 a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131dan yukar\u0131 \xE7\u0131karak
      de\u011Fi\u015Fen duvar ve engel d\xFCzenleri olu\u015Fturur. Ekstra s\u0131cak
      ve <color=#FFA845>baharatl\u0131 {</color> b\xF6lgeler Wizzolar\u0131 i\u015Faretler."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 425184382976
    m_Localized: "Orta menzilli ve \xE7ok <color=#86D1F0>d\xFC\u015F\xFCk bekleme
      s\xFCreli</color>\n<color=#86D1F0>h\u0131zl\u0131</color> bir Baloncuk f\u0131rlat\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463079919616
    m_Localized: "Yak\u0131n mesafeden patlayan bir Ciklet f\u0131rlat\u0131r.\nArkas\u0131nda
      <color=#FCABFC>yava\u015Flat\u0131c\u0131 bir alan }</color> b\u0131rak\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 492343578624
    m_Localized: "F\xFCze f\u0131rlat\u0131r.\nEtki alan\u0131nda \xE7arpt\u0131\u011F\u0131
      anda\n<color=#FFA975>patlar</color>."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 521196195840
    m_Localized: "<color=#7DFFBB>Muazzam bir savrulma</color> sa\u011Flayan \nyava\u015F
      bir Tekne \xE7a\u011F\u0131r\u0131r. \nVuruldu\u011Funda daha k\xFC\xE7\xFCk
      bir S\xFCrat Teknesine d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCr."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 546617872384
    m_Localized: "Bir Kavis \xE7izerek Bomba f\u0131rlat\u0131r.\nEtki alan\u0131nda
      patlar.\nArkas\u0131nda oyuncular\u0131 i\u015Faretleyen bir <color=#FF7B5C>sos
      alan\u0131 {</color> b\u0131rak\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 573285257216
    m_Localized: "D\xFC\u015Fmanlar\u0131 i\xE7eri \xE7eker, orta derece hasar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 602712494080
    m_Localized: "<color=#FF6EF5>G\xFCd\xFCml\xFC</color> bir Yarasa \xE7a\u011F\u0131r\u0131r.
      \nOyunculara kilitlenir.\n\xC7arpt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda ve k\u0131sa bir\ngecikmenin
      ard\u0131ndan hasar verir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629505708032
    m_Localized: "Bir Revolver \xE7\u0131kar\u0131r\nve <color=#A178FF>sa\xE7\u0131larak</color>
      ilerleyen\n<color=#A178FF>6</color> k\xFC\xE7\xFCk mermi ate\u015Fler."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655795605504
    m_Localized: "Oyuncunun <color=#FF7D87>etraf\u0131nda d\xF6nen</color>\nbir \xE7ift
      Baloncuk olu\u015Fturur.\nAyn\u0131 hedefe vurulan <color=#FF7D87>second</color>
      darbe <color=#FF7D87>kritik vuru\u015F</color> yapar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 685206065152
    m_Localized: "<color=#E05C9A>Uzun menzilli</color> bir Keskin Ni\u015Fanc\u0131
      at\u0131\u015F\u0131 yapar.\nHasar mesafeyle birlikte artar. \nDi\u011Fer baloncuklar\u0131
      <color=#E05C9A>delip ge\xE7er</color>."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 717250547712
    m_Localized: "Bir damla Sabun f\u0131rlat\u0131r.\nArkas\u0131nda <color=#8CA7FC>kaygan
      alanlar $</color> b\u0131rakarak \nbaloncuklar\u0131n h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131\nve
      oyuncular \xFCzerindeki savrulmay\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 741921443840
    m_Localized: "Hareket eden bir Duvar \xE7a\u011F\u0131r\u0131r.\n\xC7arpt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
      at\u0131\u015Flar\u0131 <color=#FFF373>geri yans\u0131t\u0131r</color>."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16121243400871936
    m_Localized: "Bir Kakt\xFCs mermisi f\u0131rlat\u0131r,\ndaha tehlikeli iki dikene
      <color=#BBFF7A>b\xF6l\xFCn\xFCr</color>."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
